<title>UK: Select to make announcement on U.S. offering.</title>
<headline>Select to make announcement on U.S. offering.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Select Appointments (Holdings) Plc said on Friday that it expects to make an announcement with regard to its proposed U.S. public offering shortly.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it had noted the movement in the share price, which had fallen 40-1/2p to 348p by 1020 GMT.</p>
<p>Select, an international staffing services group, announced in October that it was seeking a secondary stock market listing on Nasdaq, with a U.S. public offering of up to 10 million new shares and a secondary offering of existing shares.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
